WEBVTT

00:02.920 --> 00:07.320
Several more years passed you expanded the harem more than tenfold.

00:07.840 --> 00:13.840
Nightly revelry you gradually began to neglect state affairs when drunk with warm fragrance and soft jade.

00:13.920 --> 00:17.400
You strictly ordered no one is allowed to disturb.

00:25.440 --> 00:27.627
Your Highness Your Highness, you cannot enter.

00:29.160 --> 00:30.560
Your Majesty.

00:31.400 --> 00:32.800
What are you doing?

00:32.920 --> 00:36.080
Sikong Sheng, what are you doing? Wretched woman who brings disaster to the state Your Majesty.

00:40.120 --> 00:43.560
Sikong Sheng what are you doing?

00:45.480 --> 00:46.880
Are you rebelling?

00:47.320 --> 00:51.787
Father Your son was ordered to oversee the state.

00:52.360 --> 00:56.907
But if you continue like this the state will cease to be a state.

00:58.440 --> 01:01.480
Your son requests Father to abdicate.

